        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Per ITU-T X.509 and IETF RFC 5280 (as updated by IETF RFC 6818, IETF RFC 8398 and IETF RFC 8399), every x.509v3 certificate will contain basic certificate fields \"TbsCertificate\", \"SignatureAlgorithm\" and \"SignatureValue\". If any of these fields are not present in the certificate or if the relying party/validating entity is unable to process any of these fields, the relying party will reject the certificate.",
